T1  - Effectiveness of Chatbots in Mental Health Screening and Assessment: Systematic Review
AU  - Morales Gil, Isabel
AU  - Marti-Estevez, Inés
AU  - Doval, Sandra
AU  - Gutiérrez-Carrillo, José Miguel
AU  - Fausor, Rocío
