T1  - The role of AI-driven communication in delirium prevention, detection, and care for critically ill ICU patients: A systematic review with inductive thematic synthesis
AU  - Pandian, Vinciya
AU  - Rahimibashar, Farshid
AU  - Arabfard, Masoud
AU  - Alhalaiqa, Fadwa
AU  - Vahedian-Azimi, Amir
JO  - Intensive and Critical Care Nursing
VL  - 93
SP  - 104323
PY  - 2026
