T1  - Human factors in generative AI companions: a systematic literature review of trust, relational dependence, psychosocial outcomes, and responsible adoption
AU  - Piispanen, Joni-Roy
AU  - Myllyviita, Tinja
AU  - Vakkuri, Ville
AU  - Rousi, Rebekah
JO  - Information and Software Technology
VL  - 200
