T1  - Vulnerabilities in autonomous execution: A survey of security threats and defenses in LLM-driven agentic and multi-agent systems
AU  - Sammartino, Vincenzo
JO  - Knowledge-Based Systems
VL  - 352
SP  - 117001
PY  - 2026
DA  - 2026/10/25/
SN  - 0950-7051
