T1  - Generative artificial intelligence and the built environment: An analysis of sentiments and socioeconomic implications
AU  - Larbi, Joshua Amo
AU  - Tang, Llewellyn, C.M.
AU  - Mankata, Lawrence Martin
AU  - Debrah, Caleb
AU  - Ababio, Benjamin Kwaku
AU  - Ghansah, Frank Ato
